# Third-Party Licenses

This file is generated by `cargo about generate about.hbs --output-file THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md`.
Do not edit by hand. CI regenerates and diffs this file on every push and pull request.

The agentic-navigation-guide binary statically links the Rust crates listed
below. Each crate is bundled under one of the licenses it offers. The full
text of every distinct license follows, with the crates that use it.

The agentic-navigation-guide crate itself is licensed under MIT or Apache-2.0
at your option; see LICENSE-MIT and LICENSE-APACHE in this repository.

